### Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8085
@appointmentId = d3209e8d-be2d-4d23-b19d-b6baa4611019
@patientId = c0436a7c-67a8-451e-b733-fc3082c43262
@doctorId = a7a04e33-3575-422c-837f-5a5a27dbc1f7

### 1. Record a Clinical Consultation with Vitals (JSONB)
# @name recordConsultation
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/consultations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "appointmentId": "{{appointmentId}}",
  "patientId": "{{patientId}}",
  "doctorId": "{{doctorId}}",
  "chiefComplaint": "Patient presents with persistent severe frontal headaches and photo-sensitivity",
  "diagnosis": "Acute migraine without aura (ICD-10 G43.0)",
  "clinicalNotes": "Patient instructed to maintain headache diary. Prescribed Sumatriptan 50mg PRN. Follow-up in 2 weeks if symptoms persist.",
  "vitals": {
    "temperatureCelsius": 36.8,
    "systolicBp": 122,
    "diastolicBp": 78,
    "pulseRateBpm": 72,
    "respiratoryRate": 16,
    "oxygenSaturationPct": 99.0
  }
}

### 2. Get Consultation by ID
# Replace with UUID returned from POST
@consultationId = 34971bff-1877-43fd-94c4-5804e00e20d9
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/consultations/{{consultationId}}

### 3. Get Consultation by Appointment ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/consultations/appointment/{{appointmentId}}

### 4. Get Consultations by Patient ID (Paginated history)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/consultations?patientId={{patientId}}&page=0&size=10

### 5. Attempt Duplicate Consultation for Same Appointment (Should return 409 Conflict)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/consultations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "appointmentId": "{{appointmentId}}",
  "patientId": "{{patientId}}",
  "doctorId": "{{doctorId}}",
  "chiefComplaint": "Duplicate attempt",
  "diagnosis": "Should fail with conflict",
  "clinicalNotes": "Testing duplicate prevention",
  "vitals": null
}

### 6. Validation Failure Example (Should return 400 Bad Request with fieldErrors)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/consultations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "appointmentId": null,
  "patientId": null,
  "doctorId": null,
  "chiefComplaint": "",
  "diagnosis": ""
}

### 7. Non-existent Appointment Verification (Should return 404 Not Found from appointment-service check)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/consultations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "appointmentId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000",
  "patientId": "{{patientId}}",
  "doctorId": "{{doctorId}}",
  "chiefComplaint": "Fever and chills",
  "diagnosis": "Viral fever"
}

### 8. Mismatched Patient ID Verification (Should return 409 Conflict)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/consultations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "appointmentId": "{{appointmentId}}",
  "patientId": "11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111",
  "doctorId": "{{doctorId}}",
  "chiefComplaint": "Patient ID mismatch test",
  "diagnosis": "Testing patient mismatch"
}

### 9. Mismatched Doctor ID Verification (Should return 409 Conflict)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/consultations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "appointmentId": "{{appointmentId}}",
  "patientId": "{{patientId}}",
  "doctorId": "22222222-2222-2222-2222-222222222222",
  "chiefComplaint": "Doctor ID mismatch test",
  "diagnosis": "Testing doctor mismatch"
}
